WEBVTT

NOTE Tapstone promo v2. The altar's spoken lines, timed from the capture audio.

1
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.240
Touch your castle card to the stone.

2
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.470
Touch your castle to the stone to end your turn.

3
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.340
Now watch the other side move.

4
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.580
Touch your deck to the stone five times to draw your hand.

5
00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.000
Draw 4: touch the top card of your deck to the stone.

6
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.240
Turn a card face down and touch it to a pad for mana.

7
00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.970
Touch a card face up to a pad to summon it.

8
00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.460
Ashen Vanguard: touch a pad.

9
00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.260
Your move.

10
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:45.310
The board is yours, so break their keep.

11
00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.590
Draw 1: touch the top card of your deck to the stone.

12
00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:49.370
Your move.

13
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:50.970
The other seat is thinking…

